<title>UK: SGA sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued up to 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Roche Genussschein, lead manager Societe Generale Bank &amp; Trust Zurich said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 1000 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    16,000 CHF		PREMIUM	20.27 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.68 CHF		  GEARING	8.75 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.FEB.99		 PAYDATE	18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  14,700 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
